      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1939327563240817117",
      "text": "[3:15PM] #Ejigbo #TrafficUpdate \n\n Vehicular movement from Pako Oke Afa towards Jakande is proceeding smoothly. A similar condition of perfect movement is noted along the NNPC junction route down to Oju Odo. However, there is a slowdown in movement from Oju Odo in the direction of the Ikotun intersection, leading towards Old Garage.\n\n Conversely, vehicular flow from the Synagogue to the NNPC junction, and further linking Mubostic towards Canoe, is good. The route from Canoe back to Mubostic is also experiencing satisfactory movement. Traffic along both Ijegun Road and Jakande Gate towards Pako is moving at a fast pace.\n\nOur personnel are stationed at their designated points to manage traffic, and currently, no impediments have been reported.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
