      "text": "[3:24PM] #Imota #Ikorodu_IjedeRoad #TrafficUpdate \n\n A slow but consistent flow of vehicular movement is observed from Sabo Roundabout towards Sabo Onimalu, Alaka, Low Cost Housing Estate, Jendol, Nasfat, and Sawmill, extending down to Itamaga. Motorists traveling from Itamaga towards Idiroko, Cele, Gbaga, Omitoro, Eleshin, and Elepe will experience smooth transit.\n Conversely, the return journey from Elepe through Eleshin, Omitoro, Gbaga, Cele, and Idiroko to Itamaga is currently unimpeded.\n\n Similarly, traffic flow from Itamaga back towards Sawmill, Nasfat, Jendol, Low Cost Housing Estate, Alaka, Sabo Onimalu, and ultimately Sabo Roundabout is moving freely. \nOur men on duty are actively monitoring traffic situation, and no incidents causing traffic disruptions have been reported at this time.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
