      "text": "[3:51PM] #EbuteEro #Apongbon #TrafficUpdate \n\nSmooth vehicular flow is observed on the CMS Bridge heading towards the Offin Canal market stretch up to the Ijora Olopa by the NEPA intersection. Similarly, traffic is moving well along Broad Street, from the starting point to Apongbon underneath the bridge, facilitating connections to Offin Canal market and Olowogbowo.\n\n Motorists utilizing the Eko Bridge inbound Apongbon can expect good movement towards CMS, Elegbeta Mini Stadium, Ebute-Ero market, Leventis, as well as the inner and outer Marina areas. \n\nNo traffic obstructions have been reported at this time, and personnel are present at key locations to manage traffic situation.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
