      "text": "[4:51PM] #OjoduBerger #TrafficUpdate \n\nMovement is free from the Otedola axis inward Berger Oke, and continuing towards Kara-Opic in both directions. Similarly, vehicular flow is unimpeded from Isheri Olowora through River Valley, Kosoko, the VIS, Omole junction, and further along to Excellence Hotel, Yaya Abatan, Ogba, Caterpillar, extending smoothly to Odo Eran. Both lanes on Wemco Road are currently experiencing seamless traffic flow.\n\nIn the opposite direction, motorists are encountering equally smooth transit along either Ogunnusi Road or Wemco Road, all the way to River Valley, connectimg Lagos-Ibadan Expressway also reporting free movement. \n\nNo impediments to traffic is observed, and our officials are currently in their designated positions to monitor and manage the flow.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
